    "h1": "Paperclip for SEO",
    "description": "Run autonomous SEO operations with Paperclip: AI agent org charts, scheduled keyword research, content pipelines, technical audits, and multi-client agency management — all on autopilot.",
    "author": "",
    "date": "",
    "toc": [],
    "headings": [
      {
        "level": "h1",
        "text": "Paperclip for SEO"
      },
      {
        "level": "h2",
        "text": "Paperclip for SEO: The Complete Guide to Running an AI-Powered SEO Team"
      },
      {
        "level": "h2",
        "text": "Workflow Library"
      },
      {
        "level": "h3",
        "text": "Getting Started with Paperclip for SEO"
      },
      {
        "level": "h3",
        "text": "Keyword & Competitive Research"
      },
      {
        "level": "h3",
        "text": "Content Production Pipelines"
      },
      {
        "level": "h3",
        "text": "Technical SEO Automation"
      },
      {
        "level": "h3",
        "text": "Agency & Multi-Client Management"
      },
      {
        "level": "h3",
        "text": "Analytics & Reporting"
      },
      {
        "level": "h2",
        "text": "Prefer prompt-based Claude workflows?"
      }
    ],
    "paragraphHighlights": [
      "Stop manually triggering every SEO task. Paperclip lets you hire AI agents — keyword researchers, content writers, technical auditors — that run on schedules, report up an org chart, and stay within budget.",
      "Paperclip lets you build and run an autonomous SEO team — keyword researchers, content writers, and technical auditors that work on schedules, report up an org chart, and stay within budget. This guide maps all 17 workflows.",
      "Six areas. Each guide shows you the exact Paperclip setup, agent configuration, and workflow steps your team can run on day one.",
      "From zero to your first autonomous SEO agent. Understand what Paperclip is, why it changes how SEO teams operate, and how to build your first agent-powered SEO org chart.",
      "Replace manual keyword pulls and competitor reads with autonomous agents that run on a schedule — delivering fresh research every week without you lifting a finger.",
      "Build an end-to-end content machine: brief generation, multi-agent drafting, and quality review — all orchestrated in Paperclip with human approval gates.",
      "Schedule recurring audits, automate internal linking passes, and generate schema markup at scale — with Heartbeats keeping everything running without manual triggers.",
      "Run multiple client SEO programs from one Paperclip deployment. Complete data isolation per client, per-agent budget caps, and a full governance layer for agency accountability.",
      "Close the loop on autonomous SEO operations with automated reporting pipelines — recurring reports, anomaly alerts, and full audit trails delivered on Heartbeat schedules.",
      "The Claude SEO workflow library covers the same task areas — keyword research, content briefs, audits, and reporting — using structured prompts rather than autonomous agents."
    ],
