      "The GEO Community is the only fully free, no-paywall learning path covering GEO, AI SEO, AEO, benchmarks, measurement, and troubleshooting.",
      "Reforge ($1,995/year) targets senior SEO leaders who need systems thinking — co-occurrence optimization, citation optimization, and RAG workflows.",
      "Short answer: The best courses for AI SEO, AEO & GEO are CXL for advanced practitioners, Coursera for structured learning, Jellyfish for live team training, and The GEO Community for a free, open, experiment-driven path. If you need the fastest decision, pick CXL for tactical AI search workflows, Coursera for a clearer learning progression, Jellyfish for implementation and measurement, and The GEO Community for practical learning without a paywall.",
