      "2Connect Google Analytics MCP to Claude",
      "2Chain-of-Thought Prompting for Content",
      "Content gap analysis requires two inputs: what your competitors cover and what you cover. Claude can't pull rankings — but once you export that data from Semrush or Ahrefs, Claude can cross-reference, cluster, and prioritize the gaps faster than any spreadsheet workflow.",
      "Claude can't pull competitor rankings — the workflow starts with a Semrush Content Gap or Ahrefs Content Gap export, which you then feed to Claude for clustering and prioritization.",
      "The clustering step is where Claude adds the most value: it groups raw gap keywords into topic clusters and labels each by strategic type (pillar content, supporting content, FAQ, product comparison).",
      "Ask Claude to score each gap cluster by three criteria: search intent alignment with your business, existing content adjacency (do you have something close?), and estimated content production effort."
