      "Internal linking at scale is a spreadsheet problem that most teams never solve. Claude can process your sitemap, build a topic cluster map, identify orphan pages, and generate specific anchor text and placement recommendations for each page — in a workflow that takes 30 minutes instead of 30 hours.",
      "Internal linking is one of the highest-leverage on-page SEO actions with the lowest execution rate — most teams know what they should do and don't have time to do it. Claude fixes the time problem.",
      "The two-stage workflow: Stage 1 — feed Claude your sitemap and ask it to group pages into topic clusters and identify which page should be the cluster hub. Stage 2 — for each cluster, generate anchor text and recommended target URLs.",
      "Orphan page detection prompt: ask Claude to flag any page that receives no internal links from the cluster it belongs to — this is a fast-win list that requires no new content creation."
