      "Claude can't pull search volume, but it can do something Ahrefs and Semrush can't: understand why a searcher is asking a question. This guide covers how to use Claude to cluster keyword lists by intent, classify TOFU vs BOFU, and score opportunities — after you've exported the volume data.",
