      "2Connect Google Analytics MCP to Claude",
      "2Chain-of-Thought Prompting for Content",
      "Connecting Claude to GA4 via MCP is step one. The harder part is getting Claude to do useful analysis — not just recite numbers. This guide covers the prompt patterns for trend analysis, anomaly detection, executive summary writing, and multi-metric interpretation that turn raw GA4 output into decisions.",
      "Most Claude + GA4 workflows stop at 'show me last month's traffic' — the high-value work is interpretation: why did organic sessions drop 18%? Which landing pages drove the most goal completions? What changed?",
      "The anomaly detection prompt ('Flag any metric that changed by more than 15% week-over-week and give me a likely cause for each') turns Claude into a standing weekly check-in that takes 2 minutes instead of 45.",
      "Executive summary generation requires the right structure prompt: 'Summarize this GA4 data in 5 bullet points for a CMO. Lead with the most significant trend, include one specific number per bullet, and end with one recommended action.'"
