      "2Chain-of-Thought Prompting for Content",
      "Rewriting 500 title tags and meta descriptions manually takes a team weeks. With the right system prompt, CSV-style input, and a quality gate prompt, Claude can process them in batches — with consistent keyword placement, character limits enforced, and brand voice maintained across every output.",
      "The system prompt is the entire quality control system: set character limits (≤60 chars for title tags, ≤160 for meta descriptions), keyword placement rules, CTR-optimizing patterns, and brand voice constraints before any page content goes in.",
