      "6AEO vs Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) (Microsoft's Framing)",
      "7Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) vs SEO: How the User Funnel Changed",
      "Crawlability used to mean one thing. Make sure Google can access your pages. That definition still works — but it is no longer complete. The word now has two meanings depending on who you are optimizing for.",
      "Crawlability now has two meanings: SEO crawlability covers Google's Discover→Crawl→Index pipeline; GEO crawlability covers raw HTML readability for AI bots that cannot execute JavaScript.",
      "Google can render SPAs with Googlebot. GPTBot, ClaudeBot, and PerplexityBot cannot — they get an empty shell where your content should be.",
      "GSC's three URL states (Discovered, Crawled, Indexed) are Google's pipeline exclusively. AI bots operate entirely outside it."
