    "sourceTitle": "How to Create a Custom AI Search Channel Group in GA4",
    "h1": "How to Create a Custom AI Search Channel Group in GA4",
    "description": "Step-by-step: create a custom GA4 channel group with an 'AI Search' channel definition. Covers Admin setup, channel priority ordering, regex conditions, and how to use the group in Traffic acquisition reports and Explorations.",
    "author": "Rohit Singh",
