    "h1": "How DeepSeek V4 Crammed 1 Million Tokens Into 9.62 GB and Cut Inference Costs by 6×",
    "description": "DeepSeek V4 cuts long-context KV cache 90% via Hybrid Attention (CSA + HCA + sliding window). 1M tokens in 9.62 GB, 6× cheaper than GPT-5.5 — full breakdown.",
    "author": "Rohit Singh",
