    "h1": "Flesch Reading Ease Score: What It Is, Why It Predicts Reading Behavior, and How to Use It in AI Content",
    "description": "Flesch Reading Ease score explained for marketers: formula, score ranges, reading behavior research, and how to use it as a measurable quality gate in AI content workflows.",
