    "h1": "Search Everywhere Optimization Is Becoming a Buzzword — and Most People Using It Don't Understand Why It's Happening",
    "description": "Google's Thematic Search patent reorganizes broad queries into ranked themes and sub-themes. Why Search Everywhere Optimization is being misused — and what the patent actually implies for content strategy.",
