    "h1": "Why LLM Evals Matter: The Hidden Cost of Shipping AI Without Measuring Quality",
    "description": "Business case for LLM evals: cost of AI quality failures, hallucination incident rates, model drift patterns, and why systematic evaluation prevents 70% of production LLM incidents.",
